{
 "duration": 92.159,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Day thirty one, four p.m. The tower on Fourth had become a rumor.",
   "start": 0.45,
   "end": 4.862
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Four blocks of quiet you could hear.",
   "start": 5.182,
   "end": 7.252
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 7.572,
   "end": 8.572
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "A city without engines is loud in other ways.",
   "start": 8.572,
   "end": 11.521
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Dogs. Shutters. Brooms. Ten thousand people not hurrying anywhere.",
   "start": 11.841,
   "end": 17.298
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "We moved with the chalk.",
   "start": 17.618,
   "end": 18.936
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Arrows climbed the walls like ivy.",
   "start": 19.256,
   "end": 21.368
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 21.688,
   "end": 22.688
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Somebody had walked this route before us.",
   "start": 22.688,
   "end": 25.076
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The arrow knew our names before we did.",
   "start": 25.396,
   "end": 27.635
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "At the base of the tower, the gate waited.",
   "start": 27.955,
   "end": 30.457
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "A padlock, and a key balanced on top of it.",
   "start": 30.777,
   "end": 33.377
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 33.697,
   "end": 34.897
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "who": "Glitch",
   "text": "Third stair is loose. I fixed the rest.",
   "start": 34.897,
   "end": 38.755
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "You don't ask a message how it knows your stairs.",
   "start": 39.075,
   "end": 41.714
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "You just test the third step.",
   "start": 42.034,
   "end": 43.582
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "We filled till the buckets weighed like sleeping dogs.",
   "start": 43.902,
   "end": 46.877
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "On the roof ladder, hands passed them down in a chain.",
   "start": 47.197,
   "end": 50.212
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Tap water from a tower tastes like pennies and winning.",
   "start": 50.532,
   "end": 53.46
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 53.78,
   "end": 54.78
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Then we saw the valve wheel.",
   "start": 54.78,
   "end": 56.34
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Fresh oil on the threads.",
   "start": 56.66,
   "end": 58.193
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "It was warm.",
   "start": 58.513,
   "end": 59.497
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 59.817,
   "end": 61.017
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Warm, on day thirty one of no machines.",
   "start": 61.017,
   "end": 63.689
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The pipes ran anyway, like something kept its promise.",
   "start": 64.009,
   "end": 67.399
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "At home, our chalk X looked brighter than yesterday.",
   "start": 67.719,
   "end": 70.721
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "who": "Glitch",
   "text": "You're welcome.",
   "start": 71.041,
   "end": 72.322
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 72.822,
   "end": 74.022
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "A machine that oils valves.",
   "start": 74.022,
   "end": 75.819
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Or a neighbor with far too much love.",
   "start": 76.139,
   "end": 78.269
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The question climbed our stairs faster than we did.",
   "start": 78.589,
   "end": 81.404
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "If it can turn the water off, it can turn us off.",
   "start": 81.724,
   "end": 84.625
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 84.945,
   "end": 85.945
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "But it also turned the water on.",
   "start": 85.945,
   "end": 87.662
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "That's the part nobody said out loud.",
   "start": 87.982,
   "end": 90.239
  }
 ]
}